  "details": "<p>As with many Iron Age sites, the chronology of\u00a0Scratchbury Camp has been debated. Multi-period reuse of hill forts often makes precise dating difficult, if not impossible. Some Pre-Roman Iron Age sites in Britannia saw re-use following the Roman conquest.</p>",
